                                "sense_id": "6b3c0461-9efe-380e-b646-dc607f0d2aee",
                                "text": "The oldest art-traces of the palæotechnic men of central France not only surpass those of many savage races, but they indicate an intellectual aptitude in no degree inferior to the average Frenchman of the nineteenth century."
